Package: fixturePkg
Type: Package
Title: Minimal Fixture Package for This Repository's Own CI
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Predictive Ecology", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "predictiveecology@gmail.com")
Description: Not a real package and not published anywhere. It exists so the
    self-test workflow has a DESCRIPTION to resolve dependencies against.
    terra is in Imports deliberately: it links GDAL/GEOS/PROJ, so it is the
    cheapest thing that fails when the geospatial system libraries are wrong.
    abind sits under Config/Needs/self-test for a similar reason: it is in
    nothing else's dependency closure here, so its presence proves setup-r-deps
    forwarded its `needs` input, and its absence proves it did not.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    terra
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/Needs/self-test:
    abind
